      "Great Lakes Airlines\nKINGMAN TO FARMINGTON\nFrequency\nDeparts\nDaily\n6:30p\nFARMINGTON TO KINGMAN\nFrequency\nDeparts\nDaily\n6:30a\nArrives Flight\n8:50p\n5199\nArrives\n6:50a\nFlight\n5193\nKINGMAN TO LAS VEGAS\nFrequency\nDaily\nDaily\nDeparts\n7:00a\n12:50p\nArrives Flight\n7:40a\n5193\n1:30p\n5166\nLAS VEGAS TO KINGMAN\nFrequency\nDaily\nDaily\nDeparts\n11:50a\n5:40p\nArrives\n12:30p\n6:20p\nFlight\n5166\n5199\nSchedule is current July 1, 2010 and subject to change\nLowest Fares Available Online at flygreatlakes.com\nFor Questions or Information:\nToll Free: 800.554.5111\nKingman Station: 928.757.5444\n*Please arrive 90 min early if departing from a Hub\nand 60 min early if departing from any other location\nIf you are connecting to any of the airlines listed below, Great Lakes\nAirlines will gladly check your bags through to your destination as long as\nyou have proof that you are holding a confirmed ticket on that airline. For\nany other questions regarding baggage agreements, please log onto\nflygreatlakes.com or call the Reservation Center at 800-554-5111.\nAir New Zealand; Alaska Airlines; American Airlines; Bemidji Airlines;\nBWIA West Indies Airways; Cayman Airlines; Continental Airlines; Czech\nAirlines; Frontier Airlines; Hawaiian Airlines; Horizon Air; Mesaba\nAviation; Midwest Airlines; Mexicana Airlines; United Airlines; US\nAirways; Varig; Wideroe's Flyveselskap Asa"
